+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// [custom] Telegram Business support.
+//
+// The owner connects this bot to their personal account (Settings → Telegram
+// Business → Chatbots). Messages from the owner's contacts arrive as
+// business_message updates. They are UNTRUSTED: Claude can only propose a
+// draft, and the server sends it only after the owner taps "Send" in the bot
+// DM. Claude never gets a way to message a contact directly.
